# REQUIRES: verilator
# vmem-ring-flight: the entries of each vmem ring's table of reads in flight and
# of its answer-write queue (default 32). A smaller table only holds decisions
# while it is full (bubbles), never a wrong answer: the sixteen leaves of
# static-vmem-ring.test against the model of both controllers, with tables of 8
# (the least) and per-ring sizing (0: the decision lead + 2 plus the reads of an
# assumed 256-position latency, 8 to 32), at fast, slow, stalled and
# out-of-order-latency answers, with bubbles and a controller FIFO drained slowly.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/vmemring
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/f8 --static --virtual-memories ram --vmem-rings 8 --vmem-ring-flight 8 Leaf > /dev/null 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=F8 < %t/f8/foldsim_sim.mlir
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=F8N < %t/f8/foldsim_sim.mlir
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -DIW1=6 -Mdir %t/f8/obj %S/Inputs/tb_vmem_ring.sv top.sv %t/f8/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/f8/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/f8/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+1 +lo=1 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/f8/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +lo=20 +hi=200 +full=50 +stall=10 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/f8/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+3 +lo=40 +hi=600 +lo1=1 +hi1=2 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/f8/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+4 +lo=1 +fifo=8 +drain=40 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/fa --static --virtual-memories ram --vmem-rings 3 --vmem-ring-flight 0 --bubbles --nest Leaf > /dev/null 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=FA < %t/fa/foldsim_sim.mlir
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -DIW1=5 -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/fa/obj %S/Inputs/tb_vmem_ring.sv top.sv %t/fa/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/fa/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/fa/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+5 +lo=5 +hi=60 +full=30 +bubble=30 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/fa/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+6 +lo=20 +hi=600 +full=50 +bubble=60 +burst=8 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/fa/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+7 +lo=40 +hi=200 +lo1=1 +hi1=2 +fifo=8 +drain=50 | FileCheck %s
# Eight entries: flight 0..7, an answer queue of 8 (and its zero row).
# F8-DAG: %ram_ring_flight7_valid = seq.firreg
# F8N-NOT: ram_ring_flight8_valid
# F8-DAG: %ram_ring_flight_writes = seq.firmem 0, 1, undefined, undefined : <9 x {{[0-9]+}}, mask 1>
# Sixteen prefetches a frame of a short frame: the 256-position latency asks for the most (32).
# FA-DAG: %ram_ring_flight31_valid = seq.firreg
# FA-DAG: %ram_ring_flight_writes = seq.firmem 0, 1, undefined, undefined : <33 x {{[0-9]+}}, mask 1>
# CHECK: {{^}}MATCH
